---
description: Shut down test/verification servers and other background processes before finishing.
alwaysApply: true
---

# No leftover processes

Do not leave background processes running when work is done. HTTP servers started for testing or verification (dev servers, `python -m http.server`, preview, mock APIs) must be stopped before you finish.

- Prefer one-shot checks that exit (tests, curl) over long-lived servers
- If a server is required: start it, verify, then stop it
- Stop it even if verification failed
- Only kill processes this session started
- Check the terminals this session owns before finishing
